"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 3.4.6 (legacy filename is not a source number)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"36–37"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"46–47"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=(\\varphi_\\alpha)_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}\">\\(\\varphi=(\\varphi_\\alpha)_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}\\)</span> 为候选可定义全类函数族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\varphi_\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，不预先假定正规性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix},\\mathrm{Enum}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix},\\mathrm{Enum}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" href=\"?note=779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" title=\"18-df-fixed-point-set\">18-df-fixed-point-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0add8a5835559b4b\" href=\"?note=0add8a5835559b4b\" title=\"18-df-well-order-enumeration\">18-df-well-order-enumeration</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VeblenHierarchy}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{VeblenHierarchy}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是下式定义的元理论特征谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VeblenHierarchy}(\\varphi)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\varphi_0(\\beta)=\\omega^\\beta\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\varphi_\\alpha=\n\\mathrm{Enum}(\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\alpha\\;\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\varphi_\\gamma)\\})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{VeblenHierarchy}(\\varphi)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\varphi_0(\\beta)=\\omega^\\beta\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\varphi_\\alpha=\n\\mathrm{Enum}(\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\mid\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\alpha\\;\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(\\varphi_\\gamma)\\})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留历史 ID；它并非原书 Definition 6.2.1（该编号是从规则定义单调算子）。本节点是 3.4.6 的类图特征谓词；唯一的解为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a> 的递归族。候选族只是谓词参数，避免在定义待构造对象之前假定其正规性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-fixed-point-set","status":"resolved","id":"779baa2ce0d8c0d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-fixed-point-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-well-order-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"0add8a5835559b4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-fixed-point-set","status":"resolved","id":"779baa2ce0d8c0d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi=(\\varphi_\\alpha)_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}$ 为候选可定义全类函数族；$\\varphi_\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$，不预先假定正规性。$\\mathrm{Fix},\\mathrm{Enum}$ 见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]、[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-well-order-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"0add8a5835559b4b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi=(\\varphi_\\alpha)_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}$ 为候选可定义全类函数族；$\\varphi_\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$